# Best Practices

When developing Analytics Rules:

- Use reliable and validated data sources.
- Apply time filters to improve query performance.
- Tune thresholds based on normal organizational behavior.
- Map entities accurately.
- Align detections with MITRE ATT&CK.
- Test rules before enabling them in production.
- Review and update rules as attack techniques evolve.

---

# Common Challenges

SOC teams frequently encounter:

- Excessive false positives
- Missing telemetry
- Duplicate alerts
- Incorrect entity mappings
- Inefficient KQL queries
- Poorly tuned thresholds

Continuous monitoring and refinement are essential to maintaining effective detections.

